# Minimalist Monochrome Design System Implementation Plan

This plan outlines the complete conversion of both Light and Dark modes in KITCommunity to the **Minimalist Monochrome** design system, featuring a single muted red accent (`#C43E3E`), an enlarged navigation bar, and strict preservation of specified brand/calendar elements.

## Design System Guidelines

### Color System
- **Light Mode**:
  - Main Background: Pure white (`#FFFFFF`)
  - Panels / Sidebar: Off-white (`#FAFAFA`)
  - Primary Text: Near-black charcoal (`#111111`)
  - Secondary/Muted Text: Mid-gray (`#6B6B6B`)
  - Borders & Dividers: Thin hairlines in light gray (`#E5E5E5`)
  - Disabled / Placeholder Text: Light gray (`#B0B0B0`)
- **Dark Mode**:
  - Main Background: True charcoal-black (`#111214`)
  - Panels / Sidebar / Cards: Charcoal panel background (`#1A1B1E`)
  - Primary Text: Off-white (`#F5F5F5`)
  - Secondary/Muted Text: Mid-gray (`#9A9A9A`)
  - Borders & Dividers: Thin hairlines in dark gray (`#2A2A2C`)
  - Disabled / Placeholder Text: Dark gray (`#555558`)
- **Single Accent Color**:
  - Muted Red (`#C43E3E`) — used ONLY for active nav tab underline/indicator, primary buttons (`+ Post`, `Sell An Item`, `Continue`, `Send`), unread badges, and `OFFICIAL CAMPUS NOTICE` banner accent.
  - All blue/indigo/sky/purple tones across buttons, tabs, links, and badges are replaced with this monochrome grayscale + red accent system.

### Component & Typography Standards
- **Typography**: Clean sans-serif (Inter / system-ui), max 3 font sizes per screen, hierarchy driven by font weight and size rather than text color.
- **Buttons**: Primary screen action uses solid Muted Red (`#C43E3E`). Secondary buttons use solid black (`#111111` light mode) / solid white (`#FFFFFF` dark mode) or subtle hairline borders (`#E5E5E5` / `#2A2A2C`).
- **Cards**: Flat white or dark-gray cards with 1px hairline border (`#E5E5E5` / `#2A2A2C`), minimal rounded corners (6–10px), no heavy box-shadows.
- **Icons**: Single-weight line icons, grayscale only.
- **Role Badges**: Outlined pill badges in monochrome for Student, Faculty, and Moderator; Muted Red outlined pill for Admin (`border border-red-500/30 text-[#C43E3E] bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/30`).
- **Enlarged Navigation Bar**: Increased height (`py-4 px-6 lg:px-8`), larger logo image (`h-11` to `h-12`), larger text and search input.

### DO NOT CHANGE Requirements
1. **KIT College of Engineering, Kolhapur logo**: Keep pixel-identical, full original color in both light and dark mode.
2. **Academic Calendar table internal cell colors**: Yellow, olive green, sky blue, pink date cells and the green "LIVE ACTIVE CALENDAR" badge remain unchanged. Only surrounding chrome adopts monochrome styling.

