## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Verify Vite frontend builds without any compilation errors: `npm run build` in `client`.

### Manual Verification
- Verify both Light Mode (`#FFFFFF` background, `#111111` text, `#FAFAFA` panels, `#E5E5E5` borders) and Dark Mode (`#111214` background, `#F5F5F5` text, `#1A1B1E` panels, `#2A2A2C` borders) in browser.
- Verify Navbar height is enlarged with increased logo size and crisp alignment.
- Verify single muted red accent (`#C43E3E`) is used on nav tab active underline, "+ Post", "Sell An Item", "Continue", Send buttons, unread badges, and notice banner.
- Verify KIT official logo in navbar and calendar is full color original orange mark.
- Verify Academic Calendar data cells retain their semantic yellow, green, blue, and pink colors.
